OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA largely fine day, with early
OL,6,Fcloud breaking to good sunny spells.
OL,7,FCloud then thickens again through
OL,8,Fafternoon, with a few showers
OL,9,Fdeveloping later, perhaps heavy. These
OL,10,Fmost likely in the west or into
OL,11,Fsouthern coasts. Breezy, especially
OL,12,Falong coasts.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FStaying rather breezy with
OL,15,Fscattered showers spreading east
OL,16,Fovernight. These could be heavy at
OL,17,Ftimes, before gradually easing around
OL,18,Fdawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
